0 68 613 [
[(Here is a measured amplitude spectrum for the pulse train. Notice)]
[(that, other than a smallish spillover, the energy sits in one "lobe")]
[(whose changing width justifies our calling the squeeze factor the)]
[("bandwidth.")]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
